Phase 5 Task 1 — main.ts integration through the registry (FR1–FR10)

Implementation notes / design decisions:
- missionFocus is passed as an optional second parameter (a resolver) to
  createMissionRegistry (FR12); the old per-entry focus closures for
  fire/iceCream were deleted in favor of one four-way resolver.
- Drive-over during `spawned` auto-responds via headToGarbageTruck(): the FSM
  respond() runs synchronously, so finish()'s "only after the kid answered"
  gate — and its Phase 2 test — stays intact; the fleet morphs if the kid
  brought the wrong truck.
- parkPickup.reset() clears stale litter-N ids each round (new red-first test:
  fresh round after completion re-spawns collectable pieces).
- Absorb gates: voiceGulp=true for each drive-over piece (FR3); false for
  sweep — the truck's cast already voices the group (FR4) — and the sweep is
  additionally gated on litter.length > 0.
- puppyPending makes the town busy (isIdle: !puppyPending && state==='idle').
  The siren is answered only by the police cast (per-vehicle gate): clear
  pending, pawMarker.place(spot) + show(), audio.play('bark'). The helper
  hand's siren demo (demoSiren) morphs to the police car, then pressAbility().
- Complexity splits to satisfy biome noExcessiveCognitiveComplexity (max 15):
  pressAbility -> applyAbilityEvent(event) + onSirenCast(); tickPuppyMission
  -> advanceDoorRun + clearPuppyStage.
- absorb(): removed the unused carPosition parameter; guarded the indexed last
  piece (noUncheckedIndexedAccess) so celebrate() only runs when defined.
- Two pup instances (spotPup, riderPup); door run = doorRun glide
  (RIDE_HEIGHT=0.28, DOOR_RUN_SECONDS=0.7); celebration = shared celebrate()
  (confetti + sun + cheer); startPark plays the chime, startPuppy the bark
  whine. HUD police-pulse hooks deliberately deferred to Task 2 (no
  VehicleHud API yet).

Gates: pnpm check clean (106 files); pnpm typecheck clean;
CI=true pnpm test -> 516/516 in 43 files (+2 new red-first: missionRegistry
resolveFocus, parkPickup.reset fresh round).

Manual verification steps (dev server http://localhost:5173/):
Park: wait for litter spawn -> drive over pieces (any truck: a wrong one
morphs to garbage on the first piece) -> per-piece poof + gulp -> last piece
-> confetti + sun + cheer.
Puppy: spawn whine -> switch to police (or accept the helper-hand hint) ->
press siren -> paw blooms at the spot -> drive close -> pup rides the roof ->
heart -> tap the owner house in range -> door run -> confetti + cheer ->
quiet round reset.
